OL,3,GNEWSAAirport runway rebuild delay 'very
OL,4,Aconcerning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician wants to get "spades in
OL,7,Fthe ground" to get a "vital" airport
OL,8,Fproject moving forwards.
OL,10,FAlex Snowdon said news from the States
OL,11,Fof Guernsey regarding the rebuilding of
OL,12,FAlderney Airport's ageing runway being
OL,13,Fpushed back from next year to 2028 was
OL,14,F"very concerning".
OL,16,FThe Policy and Resources Committee said
OL,17,Ffurther design work was needed for the
OL,18,F#24m scheme after it received
OL,19,Fregulatory advice and feedback from the
OL,20,FStates of Alderney.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
